# Receipt header (ASCII art) printed centered on non-fiscal bills.
# Edit this file under %ProgramData%\URSPrinterAgent\receipt-header.ascii
# Changes apply on the next print job (no service restart required).
# Keep each line at most 32 characters (typical thermal receipt width).
